      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-016\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8909]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>16.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>THE USE OF SURGICAL DRAINS:</strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8910]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Indications:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8911]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>To prevent fluid accumulatio</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>n</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> that can be the breeding ground for infection and dicomfort</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8912]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>To charactorize fluid</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8913]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. To monitor leakage like ser</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ous/ frank blood, so that early detection of haemorrage can be done.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8914]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>To promote tissue apposition</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8915]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Where visceral repair has taken place to notice ana</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>s</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>o</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>motic leak earlier</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8916]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prophylactic drain with the aim </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>to reduce infection in clean woun</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>d is not indicated.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8917]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Complications of drains:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8918]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Infection</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8919]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8920]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hernia</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8921]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Kinking leeding to non fullfillment of purpose</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8922]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Material of drains:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8923]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Insert silastic material to reduce tissue reaction.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8924]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Types:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8925]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Open</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Closed</strong></em></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"4abd78884c999f709d5985f9\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-016\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Collect fluid in bag or bottlePassive\t\tActive\" viewbox=\"1895475 247650 1524000 1533525\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"84636a3daef42bf5ee991ab24a9de4ee486dc50a203d2cc47552c3b94a57a164\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"23d4bf7ae7181ad79caf\" transform=\"translate(1896701 254126)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1516380 0 L 1516380 1524000 L 0 1524000 Z\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-opacity=\"0\" stroke-width=\"6350\"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor=\"t\" transform=\"translate(0 45720)\"><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">Collect fluid in bag or </tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"1\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"25.95\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">bottle</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"7.2\" y=\"47.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">PassiveActive</tspan></text></g></g></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8926]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Open drains</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> collect</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8927]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> material into guaze </span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"8664d1f9c2f934e79fe74dd9\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-016\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 8664d1f9c2f934e79fe74dd9\" viewbox=\"2181225 19050 857250 695325\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"6719ccd4712908aa44b8e07fa7827feef79df47b1e80b1974a1fc054f019554b\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-b953535cb105a620c9cc\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arrow-end-bdebb7034f29640fff7f\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"b953535cb105a620c9cc\" transform=\"translate(2272030 87467)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(172893 248970.5) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-172893 -248970.5)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 345786 497941\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-b953535cb105a620c9cc)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"bdebb7034f29640fff7f\" transform=\"translate(2625505 71316)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 280657 543208\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-bdebb7034f29640fff7f)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8928]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> pad or stoma bag.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8929]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Usually not common</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8930]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>in gynaecology.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8931]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8932]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Closed Passive drains:</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8933]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Examples Robinsons or nasogastric tube </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8934]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Work by differential pressure between body cavities and exterior</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8935]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Closed Active Drains:</strong></em></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8936]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Also called suction drains</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8937]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Example radivac</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8938]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Valves prevent reflux of fluid back into wound </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8939]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Can lead to tissue collapse around a drain that can obstruct drain orifices</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8940]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Promote tissues apposition, leading to minimization of hematoma or seroma formation.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8941]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Suction force also keeps clear the drain from </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>debris</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8942]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Location of drains in Gynaecology:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8943]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>1. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Pelvis</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8944]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Subcutaneous drains to prevent hematoma formation</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8945]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>",
